		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Turquoise dragon-kin related to blue dragons. Long fins, crocodile-shaped, 20 feet long, witless and cruel.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 1, <strong>HP</strong> 23, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d6) or 1 shock blast, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Shock Blast</strong>. Gout lightning blast within double near. All creatures in a near-sized cube around where the blast lands, CON 12+ or 3d6 damage. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sparkblood</strong>. Electricity immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
